#: ../../user/features/code-completion.md:7
msgid "Code Completion"
msgstr "コード補完"

#: ../../user/features/code-completion.md:9
msgid ""
"The plugin provides multiple completion mechanisms to help you write code"
" faster."
msgstr "本プラグインは、コードをより速く記述するための複数の補完メカニズムを提供します。"

#: ../../user/features/code-completion.md:11
msgid "LSP Completion"
msgstr "LSP 補完"

